  <a class="btn btn-s magnetic" href="#ask" data-open-ask data-cursor="HI">Show me my site</a>
</header>

<main id="top">

<!-- 01 HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero-anchor" id="a-hero"></div>
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="label type">High-end websites for Amsterdam restaurants</p>
    <h1 class="split hero-title" data-nl="Wie honger heeft, &lt;em&gt;googlet&lt;/em&gt; eerst.">Hungry people <em>Google</em> first.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub reveal" data-nl="Voordat iemand binnenloopt, zoeken ze je op. Wij bouwen de website die ze over de drempel haalt, en die van jou bouwen we &lt;b&gt;voordat je erom vraagt.&lt;/b&gt;">Before anyone walks in, they look you up. We build the kind of website that makes them come in, and we build yours <b>before you even ask.</b></p>
    <div class="hero-ctas reveal">
      <a class="btn magnetic" href="#ask" data-open-ask data-cursor="HI">Show me my site <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn-o magnetic" href="#work" data-cursor="LOOK">See the work ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-foot mono">
    <span><span class="live-dot"></span> 3 concepts live</span>
    <span>Built in Amsterdam</span>
    <span class="scroll-hint">Scroll <i></i></span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 02 PROBLEM -->
<section class="problem" id="why">
  <div class="problem-inner">
    <div class="problem-left">
      <p class="label type">02 · Why it matters</p>
      <h2 class="scrub-words" data-nl="Je eten doet het werk. Je website &lt;em&gt;verpest het.&lt;/em&gt;">Your food is doing the work. Your website is <em>undoing it.</em></h2>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat" data-step="0"><div class="num mono-num"><span data-to="77">0</span>%</div><p>of diners check a restaurant’s website before they come.</p></div>
        <div class="stat" data-step="1"><div class="num mono-num">~<span data-to="70">0</span>%</div><p>of them say a website has put them off a restaurant.</p></div>
        <div class="stat" data-step="2"><div class="num mono-num"><span data-to="53">0</span>%</div><p>of phone visitors leave if a page takes over 3 seconds.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="kicker" data-nl="Verouderd. Onleesbaar op je telefoon. Menukaart als wazige PDF. &lt;span class=&quot;e&quot;&gt;Elk daarvan kost je een tafel.&lt;/span&gt;">Outdated. Unreadable on a phone. Menu as a blurry PDF. <span class="e">Every one of those costs you a table.</span></p>
      <p class="src mono">MGH survey of 1,101 US diners, 2019 · Google mobile speed research, 2016</p>
    </div>
    <div class="problem-right">
      <div class="crowd" id="crowd" data-state="0">
        <div class="crowd-top mono"><span id="crowd-tag">100 hungry people nearby</span><span class="crowd-n"><b id="crowd-n">100</b><small>/100</small></span></div>
        <div class="crowd-grid" id="crowd-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="crowd-load" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span class="mono">3.0s</span></div>
        <p class="crowd-cap" id="crowd-cap">Every dot is someone deciding where to eat tonight.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 03 TAKEOFF -->
<section class="takeoff" id="takeoff">
  <div class="takeoff-inner">
    <div class="takeoff-copy">
      <p class="label type">03 · What a good site does</p>
      <h2 class="split" data-nl="Goede sites staan niet stil. &lt;em&gt;Ze stijgen op.&lt;/em&gt;">Good sites don’t sit there. <em>They take off.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-box">
      <div class="axis-y"></div><div class="axis-x"></div>
      <div class="milestones">
        <div class="ms" data-at="0.1"><b>Found</b><span>on Google, at last</span></div>
        <div class="ms" data-at="0.24"><b>Clicked</b><span>because it looks the part</span></div>
        <div class="ms" data-at="0.38"><b>Called</b><span>one tap, no hunting</span></div>
        <div class="ms" data-at="0.5"><b>Booked</b><span>“table for four, Friday?”</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="liftoff split" id="liftoff" data-nl="Je restaurant, eindelijk net zo goed online als &lt;em&gt;aan tafel.&lt;/em&gt;">Your restaurant, finally as good online as it is <em>at the table.</em></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 04 HOW -->
<section class="how" id="how">
  <div class="how-pin">
    <div class="how-head">
      <p class="label type">04 · How it works</p>
      <h2 class="split" data-nl="Geen pitchdecks. &lt;em&gt;Gewoon je site.&lt;/em&gt;">No pitch decks. <em>Just your site.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="how-track" id="how-track">
      <article class="step" data-n="01">
        <div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
        <div class="mini mini-build" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="mb mb-nav"></span><span class="mb mb-hero"><em>Your place</em></span><span class="mb mb-l1"></span><span class="mb mb-l2"></span><span class="mb mb-btn"></span><span class="mb mb-c1"></span><span class="mb mb-c2"></span>
          <span class="mb-cursor"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 2l16 9-7 2-3 7z"/></svg></span><span class="mini-tag mono">Designing…</span>
        </div>
        <h3>We build it first.</h3>
        <p>A real concept of your restaurant: your menu, your hours, your street. We walk in and show it to you on a phone.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step" data-n="02">
        <div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
        <div class="mini mini-yes" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="my-hero"><span class="my-dish"></span><b>Your restaurant</b><small class="mono">Est. today</small></div>
          <span class="my-l"></span><span class="my-l s"></span>
          <span class="my-btn"><span class="t1">Make it mine</span><span class="t2">✓ It’s yours</span></span>
          <span class="my-tap"></span>
        </div>
        <h3>You say yes. Or you don’t.</h3>
        <p>Like it? It’s yours. Don’t? You lost five minutes and got a free look at your own restaurant.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step" data-n="03">
        <div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
        <div class="mini mini-go" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="mg-url mono"><i>jouwrestaurant.nl</i></span>
          <span class="mg-live mono"><span class="live-dot"></span> LIVE</span>
          <span class="mg-n n1"><b>☎</b>Incoming call</span>
          <span class="mg-n n2"><b>➚</b>Route to you</span>
          <span class="mg-n n3"><b>✓</b>Table for 4 · Fri</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Live within days.</h3>
        <p>Domain, Google, call and route buttons, all connected. You keep cooking.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="how-progress"><i id="how-bar"></i></div>
  </div>
  <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="marquee-inner" id="marq">
    <span>Fast</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Found on Google</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Made for phones</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Fully booked</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Yours in days</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Built in Amsterdam</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b>
    <span>Fast</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Found on Google</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Made for phones</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Fully booked</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Yours in days</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b><span>Built in Amsterdam</span><b><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M3.3 7l17.4 10M3.3 17L20.7 7"/></svg></b>
  </div></div>
</section>

