  <p class="src mono center">Unofficial concept designs. Not the restaurants’ own websites.</p>
</section>

<!-- 06 INSIDE -->
<section class="inside" id="inside">
  <div class="inside-head">
    <p class="label type">06 · What’s inside</p>
    <h2 class="split" data-nl="Alles wat iemand met honger nodig heeft. &lt;em&gt;Niets wat niet hoeft.&lt;/em&gt;">Everything a hungry person needs. <em>Nothing they don’t.</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="bento" id="bento">
    <div class="tile t-menu"><span class="tag mono">Menu</span><h3>A menu you can read with one thumb.</h3><p>Not a PDF. Prices, allergens, photos.</p>
