        <div><span>Matcha latte · stone-milled</span><b>€5.20</b></div><div><span>Hong Kong milk tea</span><b>€4.50</b></div><div><span>Bolo bao · cold butter</span><b>€3.80</b></div><div><span>Flat white · double shot</span><b>€4.20</b></div><div><span>Iced chrysanthemum matcha</span><b>€5.80</b></div><div><span>House blend · 250 g</span><b>€14.50</b></div>
      </div></div></div>
