    <details><summary>Reservations or delivery?<i></i></summary><p>We link the system you already use, so nothing changes in your kitchen.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What does it cost?<i></i></summary><p>Less than you think. We show you your site first, then we talk. No surprises.</p></details>
